  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "html": "十个函数，少写一半循环"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "这些函数不是\"高级技巧\"，是日常写代码的地基。认得它们，同一个逻辑就不用自己拿 <code>for</code> 拼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "enumerate：同时拿下标和值"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c1",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "names = [\"Ada\", \"Bob\", \"Cara\"]\n\nfor index, name in enumerate(names):\n    print(index, name)\n\nprint(list(enumerate(names, start=1)))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "0 Ada\n1 Bob\n2 Cara\n[(1, 'Ada'), (2, 'Bob'), (3, 'Cara')]"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>start=</code> 让编号从 1 开始，输出给人看时很常用。不要写 <code>for i in range(len(names))</code>——那样既慢又容易越界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "zip：并排走"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c2",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "names = [\"Ada\", \"Bob\", \"Cara\"]\nages = [36, 25, 41]\n\nfor name, age in zip(names, ages):\n    print(f\"{name} 今年 {age} 岁\")\n\nprint(list(zip([1, 2, 3], \"ab\")))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "Ada 今年 36 岁\nBob 今年 25 岁\nCara 今年 41 岁\n[(1, 'a'), (2, 'b')]"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>zip</code> 以<strong>最短的那个</strong>为准，多出来的直接丢掉——这是特性也是坑。要按最长的来，用 <code>itertools.zip_longest</code>（第 34 课）。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "sorted：key 才是重点"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c3",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "people = [(\"Ada\", 36), (\"Bob\", 25), (\"Cara\", 41)]\n\nprint(sorted(people, key=lambda p: p[1]))\nprint(sorted(people, key=lambda p: p[0], reverse=True))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "[('Bob', 25), ('Ada', 36), ('Cara', 41)]\n[('Cara', 41), ('Bob', 25), ('Ada', 36)]"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>sorted</code> 返回新列表，<code>list.sort()</code> 原地改。<code>key</code> 接收一个函数，返回用来比较的值——<strong>不要用它做变换</strong>，它只影响排序依据。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "多级排序靠元组："
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c4",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "rows = [(\"b\", 1), (\"a\", 2), (\"a\", 1)]\nprint(sorted(rows, key=lambda r: (r[0], r[1])))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "[('a', 1), ('a', 2), ('b', 1)]"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "any / all / sum / min / max"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c5",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "nums = [2, 4, 6]\n\nprint(all(n % 2 == 0 for n in nums))\nprint(any(n > 5 for n in nums))\nprint(sum(nums), min(nums), max(nums))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "True\nTrue\n12 2 6"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>any</code> / <code>all</code> 接收可迭代对象，<strong>短路求值</strong>：<code>any</code> 遇到第一个真就停，<code>all</code> 遇到第一个假就停。所以传生成器表达式比先建列表更划算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "空集合的边界值得一提："
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c6",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "print(all([]))\nprint(any([]))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "True\nFalse"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>all([])</code> 是 <code>True</code>——\"所有元素都满足\"在空集上平凡成立。这个默认值经常让判断逻辑出错，写 <code>if all(...)</code> 时要想到空列表的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "question": "<code>list(zip([1, 2, 3], ['a', 'b']))</code> 的结果是？",
      "options": [
        "[(1, 'a'), (2, 'b'), (3, None)]",
        "[(1, 'a'), (2, 'b')]",
        "报错：长度不一致",
        "[(1, 'a'), (2, 'b'), (None, 'c')]"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explain": "zip 以最短的可迭代对象为准，多出来的元素被丢弃，不会补 None。需要按最长对齐要用 itertools.zip_longest。"
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "s0-14-ex1",
      "title": "用 zip 对齐两个列表",
      "prompt": "给定 <code>names</code> 和 <code>scores</code>，生成 <code>pairs</code>：元素是 <code>(名字, 分数)</code> 的列表。",
      "starter": "names = [\"Ada\", \"Bob\", \"Cara\"]\nscores = [90, 85, 77]\n\n# 在下面生成 pairs\n",
      "solution": "names = [\"Ada\", \"Bob\", \"Cara\"]\nscores = [90, 85, 77]\n\npairs = list(zip(names, scores))\n",
      "tests": [
        {
          "name": "测试 1",
          "code": "assert isinstance(pairs, list), 'pairs 应该是列表'"
        },
        {
          "name": "测试 2",
          "code": "assert len(pairs) == 3, '长度应该是 3'"
        },
        {
          "name": "测试 3",
          "code": "assert pairs[0] == ('Ada', 90), '第一个元素应该是元组 (Ada, 90)'"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "<code>zip</code> 按位置把两个序列配对，得到 (名字, 分数) 的元组。",
        "<code>zip</code> 返回的是迭代器，不是列表——需要 <code>list(...)</code> 转换。",
        "完整写法：<code>pairs = list(zip(names, scores))</code>。"
      ],
      "xp": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "小结"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "<code>enumerate</code> 拿下标，<code>zip</code> 并行遍历（以最短为准）。",
        "<code>sorted(key=...)</code> 决定排序依据，多级排序返回元组。",
        "<code>any</code>/<code>all</code> 短路求值；<code>all([])</code> 是 <code>True</code>。",
        "这些函数配合生成器表达式，能替掉大量手写循环。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "prev": "s0-13-comprehensions",
  "next": "s1-15-functions"
}